      "answer_key": [
        "q1_opt_1"
      ],
      "explanation_markdown": "**Given.** $n = 0.5\\,\\text{mol}$ in $V = 2\\,\\text{L}$.\n\n**Step 1 — Definition.** $$M = \\dfrac{n_{solute}}{V_{solution\\,(\\text{L})}}.$$\n\n**Step 2 — Substitute.** $$M = \\dfrac{0.5}{2} = 0.25\\,\\text{M}.$$\n\n**Answer.** $0.25\\,\\text{M}$.",
