    },
    {
      "id": "q2",
      "type": "single_choice",
      "title_markdown": "For an aqueous solution, $K_f = 1.86\\,\\text{K kg mol}^{-1}$ and the molality is $0.5\\,\\text{m}$. Assuming no association/dissociation, the depression in freezing point $\\Delta T_f$ is:",
