      ],
      "explanation_markdown": "**Given.** $K_f = 1.86\\,\\text{K kg mol}^{-1}$, molality $m = 0.5\\,\\text{m}$.\n\n**Step 1 — Colligative relation.** $$\\Delta T_f = K_f \\, m.$$\n\n**Step 2 — Substitute.** $$\\Delta T_f = 1.86 \\times 0.5 = 0.93\\,\\text{K}.$$\n\n**Answer.** $\\Delta T_f = 0.93\\,\\text{K}$.",
